# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Form delivery (Web3Forms) — contact form, quiz, and Community Rate requests
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter  herman@mander.tech  in the "Create Access Key" box
# 3. They email that address an access key (a UUID). Check spam if it's slow.
# 4. Copy this file to  .env.local  and paste the key below
# 5. Restart the dev server (Ctrl+C, then start-dev.bat again)
#
# Every submission then arrives at the inbox you registered. The key can only
# deliver to that address, so it's safe to expose in client-side code.
#
# IMPORTANT: herman@mander.tech must actually receive mail before this works.
# Set up forwarding at whoever hosts mander.tech (Cloudflare Email Routing is
# free and takes about five minutes) pointed at an inbox you read. Register the
# Web3Forms key only after that forwarding is live, or the key's confirmation
# email will bounce and the form will silently fail.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=paste-your-access-key-here
